{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/4102-houses-of-the-fallen","id":4102,"title":"Houses of the Fallen?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-05T23:15:18-08:00","id":4102,"title":"Houses of the Fallen?","content":"Wait, are these Demons called Fallen, as well?<br /> <br /> Do we know what the different splats will be called? It was &quot;Houses&quot; in the previous WoD, but I always wondered how they missed the obvious &quot;Choirs&quot;...Maybe that'll work this time around?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T23:36:05-08:00","id":4108,"title":"","content":"The noun you're looking for is &quot;the Unchained&quot;. And it's &quot;Incarnations&quot; and &quot;Agendas&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T18:14:51-08:00","id":4760,"title":"","content":"Also, an Agenda is more like a political party, in that there isn't a real organization, but definitely leaders and an overall goal.<br /> <br /> The Integrators think rebelling was a mistake but want to rejoin on their terms, the Saboteurs think the God-Machine should go, Inquisitors want to study it and the world in general, and Tempters want to assimilate into human society (at the center of it-they're called Tempters for a reason).<br /> <br /> Similarly, Incarnations describe your initial purpose: Destroyers and Messengers are self-explanatory, Guardians do that and gathered intelligence, and Psychopomps played chessmaster. We've already had the Messenger write-up, and from the sound of it they don't really have a concept of truth or lies until they Fall, and an Unchained Messenger is a consummate manipulator and politician, not to mention often very cynical about humanity's reaction to propaganda. They were built to spread it, after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}